      "source_jp": "黄金石が不足しています\r\n一括クリアするには<COL ffdc78>黄金石<VAL>個</COL>が必要です\r\n(所持数：<VAL>)",
      "source_en": "You do not have enough Golden Gemstones.\r\nTo bulk clear, you need <COL ffdc78><VAL> Golden\r\nGemstone(s)</COL>.\r\n(Currently owned: <VAL>)",
      "text": "Du hast zu wenige Goldsteine.\r\nZum Sammelabschluss brauchst du\r\n<COL ffdc78><VAL> Goldsteine</COL>.\r\n(Im Besitz: <VAL>)"
